<title>USA: Biopharmaceutics to record $774,000 income.</title>
<headline>Biopharmaceutics to record $774,000 income.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biopharmaceutics Inc said it will record income of $774,000 in its fourth quarter and year end 1996 results because its Biopharm Lab Inc unit filed for bankruptcy protection under Chapter 7 of the Bankruptcy Code.</p>
<p>The company said that while the unit had no debt, it was not actively operating.</p>
<p>The company added that it will release its fourth-quarter and year-end results before the end of the year.</p>
</text>
